      "agentShareContent": "1speedRacespeedRacespeedRace1",
      "intro": "<p>1. You must use the \"Register Now\" button to register for the event. No registration is required for the \"0 Fees\" event—simply trade precious metal tokens to enjoy 0 fees.</p><p><br></p><p>2. Once you register for the event, all eligible deposits and trading volume during the event will be counted.</p><p><br></p><p>3. During the event, net deposit = deposits – withdrawals. A net deposit of ≥ 100 USDT is required to complete the task. Futures trading volume = opening volume + closing volume. Spot trading volume = buy volume + sell volume. Rewards are first-come, first-served.</p><p><br></p><p>4. Trading volume for the events refers to the total futures volume of eligible pairs during the event.</p><p><br></p><p>5. The amount of precious metal tokens distributed will be determined based on the token's market price at the time of the airdrop.</p><p><br></p><p>6. This event is exclusive to individual users. Market makers and institutional users are not eligible to participate and will not be rewarded.</p><p><br></p><p>7. Rewards are not stackable. If you participate in multiple precious metal events during the same period, eligibility will be determined based on the reward distribution date. For example, if you complete the tasks from two different precious metal events (Event A and Event B), and the reward distribution date of Event A is earlier than that of Event B, you will get the reward from Event A.</p><p><br></p><p>8. Refer to the official announcements for more information on perks, futures bonuses, and position airdrops. Both position airdrops and futures bonuses are valid for three days, and all rewards will be distributed within seven working days after the event. Remember to check your account balance.</p><p><br></p><p>9. In the event of bulk registrations, malicious volume manipulation, cheating, illegal activities, fraud, or other harmful behavior, WEEX will conduct a strict review and disqualify the participants involved and recover all rewards given.</p><p><br></p><p>10. WEEX reserves the right to change or modify the Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice, including but not limited to the cancellation, extension, termination, or temporary suspension of events, eligibility criteria and standards, the selection of and number of winners, and the duration of measures taken to enact any changes.</p><p><br></p><p>11. All participants shall be bound by the latest revised Terms and Conditions. WEEX reserves the right of final interpretation for this event. Contact our customer service if you have any questions.</p><p><br></p><p>12. Trading volume from abnormal activities, including API wash trading or self-trading, will not count toward event statistics or rewards.</p>",
